**Процесс**:
1. `OK FRONT QA - Выполняю техническую валидацию` → **Gates**
2. Проверки + exploratory browser (live app) — gates; suite/Playwright **parent only**
3. `memory-bank/front/qa/<epic_id>/qa-YYYYMMDD-<slug>.yaml`
4. fail|blocked → §Fix plan (`FRONT BUGFIX <subject>`)
5. **FINISH:** finish-block (`code_changed: no`|`yes` если дописали тесты) + Handoff  
